<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2684] DataStreamer doesn&apos;t stream BinaryObjects created with BinaryBuilder</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2684</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If to create a &lt;tt&gt;BinaryObject&lt;/tt&gt; using a type name of non existed class and start streaming it then nothing will be streamed because the streamer will try to deserialize binary objects and fill fail.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In general it&apos;s not to have classes for &lt;tt&gt;BinaryObjects&lt;/tt&gt; at all and work with them with &lt;tt&gt;BinaryBuilder&lt;/tt&gt; always. Thus this bug has to be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
